WEBVTT

00:50.216 --> 00:53.140
And the letters glowing through the valley fog.

00:53.481 --> 00:56.424
Rolling past the campus in an autumn log.

00:57.005 --> 00:59.849
Midnight at the shelter with my collar turned

00:59.929 --> 01:02.693
high. Watching silver headlights cut the

01:02.733 --> 01:05.877
Virginia sky. Step across the threshold, feel

01:05.917 --> 01:10.762
the diesel hum. every mile of the road to come.

01:11.502 --> 01:15.244
Out along the corridor on 460 West. Put the

01:15.264 --> 01:19.227
knocked turtle engine to the test. The mist is

01:19.307 --> 01:22.749
rising off the mountain ridge. We're flying

01:23.069 --> 01:26.331
high across the overpass bridge. Every 15

01:26.351 --> 01:30.113
minutes like a steady heart. Nothing in the dark

01:30.133 --> 01:33.776
can tear this road apart. Roll on! Route 1

01:33.796 --> 01:36.458
through the midnight glow Follow the

01:36.518 --> 01:39.461
headlights where the dreamers go From the

01:39.521 --> 01:42.984
campus mall to the edge of the night We are

01:43.024 --> 01:47.008
chasing the horizon in the amber light Hold on to

01:47.048 --> 01:50.891
the rail while the wheels spin free Route 1 is

01:50.971 --> 01:53.594
carrying my family and me

02:07.436 --> 02:11.498
Vinyl seats are cold against a tired back Rhythm

02:11.638 --> 02:15.459
of the tires on the asphalt track Passing by the

02:15.499 --> 02:18.941
diners with their neon signs Reading future

02:18.961 --> 02:22.982
stories in the highway lines We don't need a

02:23.362 --> 02:30.165
limousine We don't need a throne Long as we are

02:30.225 --> 02:32.306
riding down this road

02:35.877 --> 02:39.541
The mist is rising off the mountain ridge We're

02:39.581 --> 02:42.605
flying high across the overpass bridge Every

02:42.665 --> 02:46.811
fifteen minutes like a steady heart Nothing in

02:46.851 --> 02:50.415
the dark can tear this ride apart Roll on, round

02:50.736 --> 02:53.739
one, through the midnight glow On the

02:53.879 --> 02:56.580
headlights where the dreamers go From the

02:56.620 --> 03:00.081
campus mall to the edge of the night We are

03:00.101 --> 03:04.081
chasing the horizon in the amber light Hold on to

03:04.141 --> 03:07.902
the rail while the wheels spin free Round One is

03:07.982 --> 03:09.943
carrying my family and me!

03:45.951 --> 03:51.854
Last run of the evening, clear the final bay

03:52.895 --> 03:59.858
Carry all the weight of the world away Green

03:59.898 --> 04:06.642
lights flashing at the intersection line

04:06.702 --> 04:13.157
Everything is locked, and the night is mine Roll

04:13.197 --> 04:16.218
on! Round one! Through the midnight glow Follow

04:16.238 --> 04:20.239
the headlines where the dreamers go From the

04:20.319 --> 04:23.720
campus mall to the edge of the night We are

04:23.760 --> 04:27.461
chasing the horizon in the everlight Hold on to

04:27.501 --> 04:31.241
the rail while the wheels spin free Round one!

04:31.442 --> 04:38.563
It's carrying my family and me! Roll on! Round

04:38.863 --> 04:39.003
one!

04:44.435 --> 04:48.137
Midnight headlights in the valley fall!

